  "notes": "Nasdaq's 2024 Sustainability Report publishes a country-by-country tax transparency table (GRI 207-4) with employees, third-party revenue, profit before tax and cash corporate income tax for 39 countries; employees and tax paid are recorded here (revenue and profit by country are in the same table but are not repeated). A value of 0 means the table prints 0 (amounts are rounded to $ millions). The 10-K's 9,162 headcount includes part-time staff and non-wholly owned subsidiaries, so it differs from the 9,138 in the sustainability report. The report also has a Workforce by Gender and Country table (countries with over 50 employees) whose totals match the tax table. No state-level data is published. Nasdaq owns no real property (10-K Item 2).",
